    <string name="about_fallback">## About VexTrainer\n\nVexTrainer is an educational platform for VEX PROS robotics programming.\n\nMaster motor control, sensors, autonomous routines, PID control, and competition strategy through structured lessons and quizzes.\n\nBuilt for VEX Robotics competitors and coaches.\n\n**Version:** %1$s\n\n[vextrainer.com](https://vextrainer.com)</string>

   <!-- Privacy — fallback content -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_content_url">https://vextrainer.com/content/privacy.md</string>
    <string name="privacy_fallback">## Privacy Policy\n\n*Effective date: January 1, 2026*\n\n### Data We Collect\n\nWe collect your name, email address, and quiz/lesson progress to provide the VexTrainer service. We do not sell your data to third parties.\n\n### How We Use Your Data\n\nYour data is used solely to track your learning progress, authenticate your account, and improve the VexTrainer platform.\n\n### Data Storage\n\nYour data is stored securely on servers in the United States. Passwords are hashed and never stored in plain text.\n\n### Account Deletion\n\nYou can permanently delete your account and all associated data at any time from the Profile screen.\n\n### Contact\n\nFor privacy-related questions, contact us at prasad@bodepudi.com.</string>

